<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post3015579740070283013..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: The Plunderbund&#39;s Persecution of Phil Hart (Good News Update, July 30)</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>12</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8002312092167531222</id><published>2010-08-02T06:18:44.057-06:00</published><updated>2010-08-02T06:18:44.057-06:00</updated><title type='text'>By amazing coincidence, here is another guy named ...</title><content type='html'>By amazing coincidence, here is another guy named Hart getting the best treatment by the &amp;quot;only ones&amp;quot;:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Article, complete with amazing video, including &lt;i&gt;recordings&lt;/i&gt; of the thugs, ooops, &amp;quot;police&amp;quot;,  making up their lies after the action, but before reporting in.  &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kccn.tv/see-the-video.html&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://www.kccn.tv/see-the-video.html&lt;/a&gt;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/8002312092167531222'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/8002312092167531222'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280751524057#c8002312092167531222' title=''/><author><name>bobn</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/07715238134585125684</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1204305483"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 2, 2010 at 6:18 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7235968603334639762</id><published>2010-08-01T23:18:58.022-06:00</published><updated>2010-08-01T23:18:58.022-06:00</updated><title type='text'>While I admire Mr. Hart, in this example at least,...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;While I admire Mr. Hart, in this example at least, in trying to point out that the emperor has no clothes, it does remind me of someone who is trying to cast out Beelzebub in the name of Beelzebub.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Nice analogy, MoT!  That is, in essence, exactly the case here.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/7235968603334639762'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/7235968603334639762'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280726338022#c7235968603334639762' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 1, 2010 at 11:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2235507063728290134</id><published>2010-08-01T02:05:07.414-06:00</published><updated>2010-08-01T02:05:07.414-06:00</updated><title type='text'>While I admire Mr. Hart, in this example at least,...</title><content type='html'>While I admire Mr. Hart, in this example at least, in trying to point out that the emperor has no clothes, it does remind me of someone who is trying to cast out Beelzebub in the name of Beelzebub.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/2235507063728290134'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/2235507063728290134'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280649907414#c2235507063728290134' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 1, 2010 at 2:05 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3494907210664607245</id><published>2010-07-30T22:02:25.931-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-30T22:02:25.931-06:00</updated><title type='text'>What is most disturbing is the idea that those who...</title><content type='html'>What is most disturbing is the idea that those who read anything questioning the legal underpinning of the income tax are considered threats to the federal government&amp;#39;s power. Apparently, tax serfs must be kept blissfully ignorant. No, it is not quite book burning but the threat of retaliation for  self-education and thought crime makes it nearly so.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/3494907210664607245'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/3494907210664607245'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280548945931#c3494907210664607245' title=''/><author><name>Marc Swanson</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05638073945201888881</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1138264686"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 30, 2010 at 10:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5948661305138658832</id><published>2010-07-30T16:52:41.272-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-30T16:52:41.272-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This may result in litigation, and if it does, Har...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;This may result in litigation, and if it does, Hart predicts, &amp;quot;I&amp;#39;ll win.&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Let&amp;#39;s hope so.  Of course this assumes that the case will go to trial in a court uncorrupted by politics or judicial/prosecutorial misconduct, a highly risky proposition at best.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And then there&amp;#39;s the feds to contend with.  I don&amp;#39;t see many grounds for optimism on that score.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/5948661305138658832'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/5948661305138658832'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280530361272#c5948661305138658832' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 30, 2010 at 4:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9204594930904152377</id><published>2010-07-28T16:24:23.179-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-28T16:24:23.179-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Well done, Will.  Another high-quality column!</title><content type='html'>Well done, Will.  Another high-quality column!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/9204594930904152377'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/9204594930904152377'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280355863179#c9204594930904152377' title=''/><author><name>Bob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/16565620274260288512</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 28, 2010 at 4:24 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3408984253753162647</id><published>2010-07-28T11:59:26.639-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-28T11:59:26.639-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks, Col. Bunny. The PayPal button should work ...</title><content type='html'>Thanks, Col. Bunny. The PayPal button should work now. God bless.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/3408984253753162647'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/3408984253753162647'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280339966639#c3408984253753162647' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/TDZ20b67tHI/AAAAAAAAGuY/tl4ybiFJNmE/S220/Will.jpeg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 28, 2010 at 11:59 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2079984032030503608</id><published>2010-07-28T11:36:57.084-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-28T11:36:57.084-06:00</updated><title type='text'>PS -- Your Donate button didn&amp;#39;t work.</title><content type='html'>PS -- Your Donate button didn&amp;#39;t work.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/2079984032030503608'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/2079984032030503608'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280338617084#c2079984032030503608' title=''/><author><name>Col. B. Bunny</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09590364016079745156</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://photos1.blogger.com/blogger2/5287/1302/200/Descartes.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-61133913"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 28, 2010 at 11:36 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1083760373596284039</id><published>2010-07-28T11:35:58.463-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-28T11:35:58.463-06:00</updated><title type='text'>An excellent post, Mr. Grigg.  The egregious behav...</title><content type='html'>An excellent post, Mr. Grigg.  The egregious behavior of the IRS and their lickspittles in state government shows the fangs behind the lips of our feral governments.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The demand for the names is just stunning.  Would that I had more experience with 1983 lawsuits.  Where is the ACLU in this?  Answer: on extended break, as usual.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Agreed on the third party.  After reading about the state repubs, it&amp;#39;s yet clearer that Mr. Buchanan&amp;#39;s is the money quote.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/1083760373596284039'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/1083760373596284039'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280338558463#c1083760373596284039' title=''/><author><name>Col. B. Bunny</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09590364016079745156</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://photos1.blogger.com/blogger2/5287/1302/200/Descartes.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-61133913"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 28, 2010 at 11:35 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4103632199713134279</id><published>2010-07-28T09:39:04.163-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-28T09:39:04.163-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The republicans in Idaho are showing the veracity ...</title><content type='html'>The republicans in Idaho are showing the veracity of the statement by P. Buchanan:  the repubs and dems are merely the right and left wings of the same bird of prey.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Unless and until a viable third party emerges, there will never be any change in the abomination that America become amerika represents.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It is beyond time to &amp;quot;think outside the box&amp;quot;.  It is time to GET OUT OF THE BOX ENTIRELY.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/4103632199713134279'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/4103632199713134279'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280331544163#c4103632199713134279' title=''/><author><name>Kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1008136792"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 28, 2010 at 9:39 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1890184191704435458</id><published>2010-07-27T22:12:53.846-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-27T22:12:53.846-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I forgot about Rep. Hart&amp;#39;s vote to criminalize...</title><content type='html'>I forgot about Rep. Hart&amp;#39;s vote to criminalize non-state-approved midwifery, which was at best an indefensible lapse on his part.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/1890184191704435458'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/1890184191704435458'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280290373846#c1890184191704435458' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/TDZ20b67tHI/AAAAAAAAGuY/tl4ybiFJNmE/S220/Will.jpeg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 27, 2010 at 10:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6339891649349476056</id><published>2010-07-27T21:46:42.373-06:00</published><updated>2010-07-27T21:46:42.373-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Phil Hart should have our support in his battle wi...</title><content type='html'>Phil Hart should have our support in his battle with the IRS.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;a reluctant politician by conviction&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Had Phil Hart resisted the urge to vote FOR midwifery licensing he would have more credibility as a legislator.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.preservingmidwifery.org/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.preservingmidwifery.org/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Instead he voted to put midwives in handcuffs if they do not seek the permission of the state to help expectant mothers.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/6339891649349476056'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3015579740070283013/comments/default/6339891649349476056'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html?showComment=1280288802373#c6339891649349476056' title=''/><author><name>Scott Watson</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/07/plunderbunds-persecution-of-phil-hart.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3015579740070283013' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3015579740070283013' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1481988100"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 27, 2010 at 9:46 PM"/></entry></feed>